### Phase 6: Homepage LCP Optimization (CRITICAL)

**This is make-or-break for SSO success.**

#### Common LCP Elements:
- **Slider**: Don't lazy-load slider JS OR rebuild in vanilla JS
- **Hero Image**: Remove lazy-load attributes, add `fetchpriority="high"`
- **Video**: Use `poster` attribute

Example:
```liquid
<video poster="{{ section.settings.poster | image_url }}">
    <source src="{{ section.settings.video_desktop }}" type='video/mp4' priority="high">
</video>
```

### Phase 7: Image Preloading

#### Shopify Native:
```liquid
{{ product | image_url: width: 200 | image_tag: preload: true }}
```

#### Manual:
```html
<link rel="preload" href="image.jpg" as="image" />
```

